// expect-stdout: 128 lines, 0 failures

// A sample of UCD 18.0.0 GraphemeBreakTest.txt (lines of more than three code
// points weighted): `graphemes` cuts the joined text into the pieces
// between the `÷` marks, from the front and from the back.
